{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"grp-engine","type":"group","x":-1840,"y":1240,"width":2440,"height":1185,"color":"5","label":"engine (Motor Base Reutilizable - Sin dependencias a game.*)"},
		{"id":"grp-game-scenes","type":"group","x":-1555,"y":-1000,"width":2135,"height":940,"color":"4","label":"game.scenes (Escenas y Lógica Rítmica)"},
		{"id":"grp-editor","type":"group","x":2000,"y":1340,"width":920,"height":1140,"color":"1","label":"level_editor (D @nogc + raylib-d) & Contratos Compartidos"},
		{"id":"grp-game-entry","type":"group","x":280,"y":-2120,"width":820,"height":852,"color":"6","label":"game (Entrada, Config y Estado Global)"},
		{"id":"grp-game-notes","type":"group","x":-2120,"y":-1760,"width":1000,"height":620,"color":"3","label":"game.core.notes (Parser .osu y Empaquetado Bitwise)"},
		{"id":"grp-game-objects","type":"group","x":-2370,"y":520,"width":1060,"height":400,"color":"3","label":"game.core.game_objects (Entidades RPG)"},
		{"id":"grp-dialogs","type":"group","x":1000,"y":1340,"width":720,"height":540,"color":"2","label":"Sistema de Diálogos (engine.dialogs + game.core.dialogs)"},
		{"id":"node-physics","type":"text","text":"### engine.physics\n- `Box extends GameObject` (AABB `intersects`)\n- `CharacterBody extends Box` (`moveAndSlide(dt)` con sub-stepping)","x":-1765,"y":1330,"width":280,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-kbinput","type":"text","text":"### KBInput\n`engine/KBInput.java`\n- Estado de teclas frame actual vs previo\n- `isKeyPressed`, `wasKeyJustPressed`, `wasKeyJustReleased`","x":-1745,"y":1635,"width":240,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-gameobject","type":"text","text":"### engine.objects\n- `GameObject` (abstract: `id`, `group`, `toXML`, `fromXML`)\n- `IUpdate` (`update(dt)`)\n- `IDraw` (`draw(PGraphics)`)","x":-1430,"y":1328,"width":270,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-draw","type":"text","text":"### engine.draw\n- `Drawable` (interface)\n- `Sprite2D extends GameObject` (animación rows/cols, zIndex)\n- `Tilemap2D extends GameObject`\n- `Camera2D` (rotate -> scale -> translate)","x":-1080,"y":1330,"width":310,"height":275,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-audio","type":"text","text":"### engine.audio + TinySound\n- `Audio`: SFX vía `TinySound`, BGM vía `MusicTrack`\n- `MusicTrack`: `javax.sound.sampled.Clip` (WAV)\n- `kuusisto/tinysound/*` (librería embebida)","x":-720,"y":1328,"width":300,"height":298,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-rotncore","type":"text","text":"### ROTNCore\n`game/scenes/ROTNCore.java`\n- Juicio 6K (`PERFECT`, `GREAT`, `GOOD`, `MISS`)\n- Manejo de Hold Notes, combo, score y pausa","x":-1060,"y":-910,"width":270,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-player","type":"text","text":"### Player\n`game/core/game_objects/Player.java`\nExtiende `CharacterBody`\nImplementa `IUpdate`, `IDraw`\n- Movimiento 4/8 dir + colisiones","x":-2330,"y":580,"width":250,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-npc","type":"text","text":"### NPC\n`game/core/game_objects/NPC.java`\nExtiende `GameObject`\nImplementa `IUpdate`, `IDraw`\n- `<Body>`, `<Area>`, `<Sprite>`, `dialogId`","x":-1800,"y":580,"width":220,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-chest","type":"text","text":"### Chest\n`game/core/game_objects/Chest.java`\nExtiende `GameObject`\n- Otorga ítems/power-ups via `GameState`","x":-2050,"y":590,"width":220,"height":290,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-changer","type":"text","text":"### SceneChanger\n`game/core/game_objects/SceneChanger.java`\nExtiende `GameObject`\n- Portales/salidas con `targetScene` y spawn","x":-1555,"y":600,"width":220,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-editor-d","type":"text","text":"### level_editor (D `@nogc nothrow` + raylib-d + raygui)\n- `app.d` + `engine/core.d` + `engine/scene.d` + `path_utils.d` + `tinyfd.d`\n- `map_editor.d` (4 pestañas):\n  1. `tilemap_tab.d` (mapa de tiles)\n  2. `tileset_tab.d` (paleta)\n  3. `dialogs_editor_tab.d` + `dialogs_data.d` (grafo nodal JSON)\n  4. `level_editor_tab.d` + `level_hierarchy_panel.d` + `level_inspector_panel.d` (`Box`, `Sprite`, `Struct`)\n- `project_manager.d`: proyectos `.procshit`\n- `xml_scene.d`: parser/serializador XML propio","x":2030,"y":1400,"width":850,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-contracts","type":"text","text":"### Contratos Compartidos (`resources/`)\n1. **Escenas `.xml`** (`resources/scenes/*.xml`):\n   `<Scene resources=\"...\" dialogs=\"...\" start-dialog=\"...\">`\n   Nodos: `<Box>`, `<Sprite2D>`, `<Tilemap2D>`, `<NPC>`, `<Chest>`, `<SceneChanger>`\n2. **Diálogos `.json`** (`resources/dialogs/*.json`):\n   Grafo de nodos con opciones, flags y directivas (`__loads__`, `__loadr__`, `__save_next__`)\n3. **Beatmaps `.osu`** (`resources/songs/...`):\n   Formato osu!mania 6K leído por `OsuManiaReader`\n4. **Proyecto `.procshit`**:\n   Índice clave=valor del editor (solo rutas relativas)","x":2030,"y":2065,"width":850,"height":360,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node-resources","type":"text","text":"### ResourcesManager\n`engine/ResourcesManager.java`\n- Resuelve rutas relativas desde XML\n- Cachea `PImage`\n- `loadCustomObject` por reflexión (ctor vacío)","x":130,"y":2100,"width":420,"height":290,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-tppacker","type":"text","text":"### TimingPointPacker\n`game/core/notes/TimingPointPacker.java`\n- Empaqueta timing point en `long`: timeMs, uninherited, beatLength","x":-2080,"y":-1435,"width":290,"height":255,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-notepacker","type":"text","text":"### NotePacker\n`game/core/notes/NotePacker.java`\n- Empaqueta nota en `long` (64 bits) sin allocaciones: lane, startTime, duration","x":-2080,"y":-1735,"width":290,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-main","type":"text","text":"### Main\n`game/Main.java`\nExtiende `PApplet` (Processing 4).\n- Ventana `1920x1080` (`P2D`), virtual `480x270`\n- Inicializa `Engine`, `Config`, `Global.player`\n- Arranca con `InitScene`","x":770,"y":-1623,"width":290,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-config","type":"text","text":"### Config\n`game/Config.java`\n- Controles 6K (`RhythmButtons` / Alt)\n- Controles `RPGButtons` y `UIButtons`\n- Carga/guarda `.config` (volumen, mute)","x":770,"y":-2060,"width":280,"height":310,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-global","type":"text","text":"### Global\n`game/Global.java`\n- `BASE_W = 480`, `BASE_H = 270`\n- Instancia global `Global.player`","x":310,"y":-1960,"width":290,"height":270,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-gamestate","type":"text","text":"### GameState\n`game/core/GameState.java`\n- Inventario (`HEAL`, `KEY`, `POWERUP`, `MISC`)\n- Estrategia de curación (`OPTIMAL`/`MINIMAL`)\n- Flags de diálogo, guardado y spawn pendiente","x":310,"y":-1623,"width":280,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node-rpgscene","type":"text","text":"### RPGScene\n`game/scenes/RPGScene.java`\nExtiende `Scene`\n- Exploración top-down con `Camera2D` siguiendo a `Player`\n- `parseCustomNode`: `<NPC>`, `<Chest>`, `<SceneChanger>`\n- Menú celular (curación, power-ups, inventario)\n- Dispara diálogos y transiciones a `RPGScene` / `ROTNScene`","x":-360,"y":-855,"width":460,"height":430,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-rotnscene","type":"text","text":"### ROTNScene\n`game/scenes/ROTNScene.java`\nExtiende `Scene`\n- Escena de combate rítmico de 6 carriles\n- Renderiza carriles, notas, combo, score y pausa\n- Usa `ROTNCore` + `OsuManiaReader`","x":-1445,"y":-460,"width":270,"height":345,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node-scene","type":"text","text":"### Scene\n`engine/Scene.java`\n- Carga XML vía `ResourcesManager`\n- `parseBaseNodes` (`Box`, `Sprite2D`) + `parseCustomNode`\n- Pausa objetos si `DialogManager.isActive()`","x":180,"y":1300,"width":320,"height":355,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-engine","type":"text","text":"### Engine\n`engine/Engine.java`\n- Loop Processing (`pre`, `draw`, `keyEvent`)\n- PGraphics virtual `480x270` + `ControlP5`\n- `changeScene(Scene)`","x":-360,"y":1345,"width":380,"height":265,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node-eng-dialog","type":"text","text":"### engine.dialogs\n`DialogManager.java` + `GameDialog.java`\n- Carga grafos JSON de diálogo\n- Directivas `__save_next__`, `next`, `__loads__`","x":1030,"y":1363,"width":670,"height":230,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-game-dialog","type":"text","text":"### game.core.dialogs\n`DialogManager.java` + `RPGDialog.java`\n- Variante específica RPG con `Config.UIButtons` y `__loadr__` hacia `ROTNScene`","x":1030,"y":1620,"width":670,"height":225,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node-osureader","type":"text","text":"### OsuManiaReader\n`game/core/notes/OsuManiaReader.java`\n- Parsea `.osu` (`[General]`, `[TimingPoints]`, `[HitObjects]`, `[Events]`)\n- Mapea `x (0..512)` a 6 carriles (`0..5`)","x":-1480,"y":-1632,"width":327,"height":325,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node-initscene","type":"text","text":"### InitScene\n`game/scenes/InitScene.java`\nExtiende `Scene`\n- Menú principal `ControlP5` (Play, Freeplay, Settings, Exit)\n- Carga partida o inicia `beach_ruins.xml`","x":140,"y":-425,"width":400,"height":310,"color":"4"}
	],
